# Everything here is excluded from the Vercel deployment.
#
# Generated HTML is committed to the repo root, so Vercel serves it directly as a
# static site with no build step. That means the deploy root is the repo root, and
# anything not excluded here becomes publicly fetchable — and crawlable, since
# robots.txt allows everything.

# Build system and sources — the output is already committed.
build/
src/
data/
test/
package.json
package-lock.json

# Internal documentation. PLACEHOLDER_CONTENT.md in particular is a risk register
# naming unreviewed legal pages and unwired forms; it must not be public.
docs/
.superpowers/
*.md

# Repo metadata
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/
